<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-ANTON WINS WORLD MEN'S MARATHON TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-ANTON WINS WORLD MEN'S MARATHON TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spaniard Abel Anton won the world men's marathon gold medal on Sunday.</p>
<p>Martin Fiz of Spain took the silver and Australian Steve Moneghetti the bronze.</p>
</text>
